{'symbol': 'DHR', 'date': '2023-03-07 08:00:00', 'title': "DANAHER PARTNERS WITH THE UNIVERSITY OF PENNSYLVANIA'S CENTER FOR CELLULAR IMMUNOTHERAPIES TO ADDRESS MANUFACTURING CHALLENGES IMPACTING THE UPTAKE OF CELL THERAPIES", 'text': 'WASHINGTON , MARCH 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DANAHER CORPORATION (NYSE: DHR), A GLOBAL SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY INNOVATOR, TODAY ANNOUNCED A STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP WITH THE UNIVERSITY OF PENNSYLVANIA (PENN) FOCUSING ON CELL THERAPY INNOVATION. THE MULTI-YEAR PARTNERSHIP AIMS TO DEVELOP NEW TECHNOLOGIES THAT WILL IMPROVE THE CONSISTENCY OF CLINICAL OUTCOMES FOR PATIENTS AND OVERCOME MANUFACTURING BOTTLENECKS IN THE DELIVERY OF NEXT GENERATION ENGINEERED CELL PRODUCTS.'}